/-!
# Exact polynomial data for the F11 coordinate eliminant

This module defines three integer polynomials in `y = k^2` and an even
degree-102 cofactor. The degree-252 eliminant is their product `P150 * R102`.
Coefficient lists are in ascending degree order. Subsequent certificate
modules prove the relations to the phase equations using these exact data.
-/

/-- Horner construction for an ascending list of integral coefficients. -/
def polynomialOfCoefficientsZ (coeffs : List ℤ) : ℤ[X] :=
  coeffs.foldr (fun c p => C c + X * p) 0

